# PRock01a route (item100b, re-timed item100c), Unreal units / seconds.
#
# Input only: no teleport, set_goal, take_control, weapon/item grant or health edit.
# The level's own intro cine (CineController21) opens the starting cell Porte13 at ~104.6 s.
# The route waits it out, leaves the cell, and trails the lead guard Cine3:
# XIDCine.EscortManager walks both guards west through the corridor and down the stairs, so a
# careful player stays behind Maton1 and ahead of Maton2's 130 UU beatdown ring. At the stair top
# the route pushes the player past PositionInfo37 (x < 3439.8) so the escort's TestXIIIDansEscalier
# fires and Maton2 descends, then continues south toward objective 0 (goal 92 at (3072,-1776)).
# The next blocker is the locked Porte9 (UnlockItemCode ClefDebarrasLingerie) at (3032,-3120): the
# player stops at (3011,-3070).
#
# item100c re-time: removing the item100b `Target`-within-`CollisionRadius` gate (the friction now
# applies every steered-walking tick) slides the escort's rear guard further along its marker, so
# the item100b 180 UU follow distance clipped the player once (t=176.4, 150 -> 136). The follow
# distance is widened to 210 UU; measured 0 baton blows, health 150, the escort reaches
# STA_EndOfEscort and objective 0 is not completed (goal 92 is fired by the escort cine's
# `event objectif92`). See local/reports/item100-prock01a.md.
t=0.50 goto 6096 -669
t=2.00 forward 0
# Wait through the cell release; Porte13 re-opens on contact (PlayerTriggerToggle).
t=150.0 goto 6140 -880
t=152.0 goto 6301 -400
# Trail the escort's lead guard (Cine3) at 180 UU.
t=153.0 follow Cine3 210
# Enter the stairwell past PositionInfo37 from the north lane (away from Maton1's path), then
# descend the stairs behind the escort.
t=171.4 follow off
t=171.5 goto 3430 300
t=173.5 goto 2950 476 -1432
t=176.5 goto 3050 -478 -1432
# Porte3 (TriggerToggle) opens on the player's bump; wait it out then pass.
t=182.0 goto 3168 -536 -1432
t=202.0 goto 3296 -703 -1432
t=206.0 goto 3296 -1152 -1432
t=210.0 goto 2880 -1655 -1432
t=215.0 goto 3072 -1776 -1488
t=218.0 goto 3192 -2110 -1432
t=221.0 goto 3192 -2280 -1432
t=225.0 goto 3169 -2975 -1432
t=232.0 goto 3184 -3157 -1446
t=235.0 goto 3011 -3262 -1458
t=242.0 forward 0
